    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Title:</strong><br><i>Sheep vs Tigers</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Genre:</strong><br>Turn-Based Strategy Puzzle Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual-Character Rivalry System:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player controls a sheep on a grid-based map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sheep must outmaneuver AI-controlled tigers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both sides take turns, with each move triggering the opponent\u2019s response.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sheep\u2019s Special Abilities:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can push boxes to alter the map layout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is to trap all tigers by strategically positioning boxes, rendering them immobile.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tiger\u2019s Behavior Patterns:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI tigers actively track the sheep\u2019s position.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a tiger moves adjacent to the sheep, it will devour the sheep, resulting in failure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tigers calculate the shortest path to reach the sheep.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Flow:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players select a level from the stage selection menu.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the sheep to move and push boxes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each sheep move, the tigers take their turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Successfully trapping all tigers leads to victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the sheep is caught, players can instantly reset the level.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Target Audience:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of strategic puzzle games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enthusiasts of block-pushing mechanics (e.g., <i>Sokoban</i>).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual strategy gamers.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Title:</strong><br><i>Sheep vs Tigers</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Genre:</strong><br>Turn-Based Strategy Puzzle Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual-Character Rivalry System:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player controls a sheep on a grid-based map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sheep must outmaneuver AI-controlled tigers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both sides take turns, with each move triggering the opponent\u2019s response.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sheep\u2019s Special Abilities:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can push boxes to alter the map layout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is to trap all tigers by strategically positioning boxes, rendering them immobile.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tiger\u2019s Behavior Patterns:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI tigers actively track the sheep\u2019s position.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a tiger moves adjacent to the sheep, it will devour the sheep, resulting in failure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tigers calculate the shortest path to reach the sheep.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Flow:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players select a level from the stage selection menu.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the sheep to move and push boxes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each sheep move, the tigers take their turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Successfully trapping all tigers leads to victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the sheep is caught, players can instantly reset the level.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Target Audience:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of strategic puzzle games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enthusiasts of block-pushing mechanics (e.g., <i>Sokoban</i>).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual strategy gamers.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A timid sheep must outsmart fierce tigers in this turn-based puzzle game. Push crates to trap tigers and escape. Each move matters\u2014plan wisely or face defeat! Can you survive the jungle",
